# Copy to `.env` to override. The compose default points at the shared Animus
# model store beside the checkout (`../../Animus/Models`), so a standard suite
# layout needs nothing here.
#
# Set this only if your GGUFs live somewhere else — another drive, a mounted
# NAS share, an absolute path. Both forms work:
#
#MODELS_PATH=/srv/models/gguf
#MODELS_PATH=X:\path\to\your\gguf
#
# `.env` itself is gitignored on purpose: it was once TRACKED and pinned to one
# machine's drive, which overrode the compose default on every checkout and
# broke `docker compose up` anywhere that drive was not mapped (sprint 97).
